:: Act3_School_Infirmary {"position":"700,1700","size":"100,100"}
<<nobr>>
<<set $currentLocation to "infirmary">>
<<set $activeMap to "Highschool Ground">>
<<set _arrivedLate to (visited("Act2_5_MarcusCabin"))>>
<</nobr>>

<div class="vn-container">
    <div class="vn-dialogue-box" style="justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; max-height: 100vh !important; padding: 20px; overflow-y: auto;">
        <div style="text-align:center; color:#888; font-size:0.8em; margin-bottom:15px; letter-spacing:3px; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;">
            GROUND FLOOR — EMERGENCY INFIRMARY
        </div>
        <div style="width: 100%; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 20px auto; border: 2px solid #333; overflow: hidden; position: relative; box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);">
            <img src="image/Act3_Timberline/infirmary.gif" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; opacity: 0.9; filter: contrast(1.1) brightness(0.9);">
        </div>
        <div style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); padding: 20px; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-blue); font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; color: #ccc; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 auto 25px auto; max-width: 700px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left;">
            <span id="vn-infirmary-main">

<<if not $thorne_met>>
    <<if _arrivedLate>>
        The infirmary is dead quiet. It smells of dried sweat, cold coffee, and old blood.
        <br><br>
        Every desk has been pushed against the walls to make space for cots. Most are occupied by survivors wrapped in mismatched blankets, their chests rising and falling in exhausted, feverish rhythms.
        <br><br>
        A portable lamp flickers above a medical tray. 
        <br><br>
        A man in a stained medical coat is sitting on an overturned bucket, staring blankly at a blood-soaked rag in his hands. He looks like he hasn't slept in days. The tray next to him is completely empty of supplies.
        <br><br>
        He hears your footsteps and slowly looks up.
        <br><br>
        <<chat "Exhausted Doctor" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "If you're injured, sit against the wall and wait. If you're armed, keep the weapon pointed at the floor.">>
        <br><br>
        He tosses the bloody rag into a bin and stands up, wincing as his knees pop.
        <br><br>
        <<chat "Dr. Thorne" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "Dr. Adrian Thorne. I used to work at St. Gabriel's. Now I work wherever people are still breathing. The long night is over, but infection doesn't sleep.">>
    <<else>>
        The smell reaches you before you fully enter the room.
        <br><br>
        Antiseptic. Sweat. Old blood.
        <br><br>
        Every desk has been pushed against the walls to make space for cots. Some are occupied by survivors wrapped in mismatched blankets. Others are empty, their sheets folded with an uncomfortable neatness.
        <br><br>
        A portable lamp flickers above the nearest cot.
        <br><br>
        A man in a stained medical coat is bent over a wounded survivor. One hand presses firmly against a blood-soaked bandage while the other searches through an almost empty tray of supplies.
        <br><br>
        His fingers move from one compartment to another. Gauze. Empty. Alcohol wipes. Empty. Antibiotics. Nothing.
        <br><br>
        The wounded survivor lets out a weak cry. The man immediately leans closer.
        <br><br>
        <<chat "Unknown Doctor" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "Stay with me. You hear me? Keep your eyes open.">>
        <br><br>
        You take another step into the room. The floorboard creaks.
        <br><br>
        <<chat "Unknown Doctor" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "Stop there.">>
        <br><br>
        He does not turn around.
        <br><br>
        <<chat "Unknown Doctor" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "If you're injured, sit against the wall and wait. If you're armed, keep the weapon pointed at the floor. And if you're here to ask whether anyone has seen your friends, ask quietly.">>
        <br><br>
        The survivor on the cot suddenly convulses. The doctor grabs the patient's shoulder and presses harder against the wound. For several seconds, the only sounds are strained breathing and the faint hum of the emergency lamp. Finally, the patient settles.
        <br><br>
        The man slowly removes his blood-stained gloves and turns toward you.
        <br><br>
        <<chat "Dr. Thorne" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "Dr. Adrian Thorne. I used to work at St. Gabriel's Medical Center. Now I work wherever people are still breathing.">>
    <</if>>

    <<set $thorne_met to true>>
    <<set $thorne_intro_seen to true>>

    <div class="choice-menu" style="margin-top:20px;">
        <button style="border-left-color: var(--accent-gold) !important;">
            <<link "Ask about the wounded survivor ▼">>
                <<run $(".vn-dialogue-box").scrollTop(0)>>
                <<addTime 3>>
                <<set $thorne_topic_patient to true>>
                <<goto "Act3_School_Infirmary">>
            <</link>>
            <span class="btn-sub">Find out how serious the situation is.</span>
        </button>

        <button style="border-left-color: var(--accent-gold) !important;">
            <<link "Ask what happened to this place ▼">>
                <<run $(".vn-dialogue-box").scrollTop(0)>>
                <<addTime 3>>
                <<set $thorne_topic_school to true>>
                <<goto "Act3_School_Infirmary">>
            <</link>>
            <span class="btn-sub">Learn how the school became an emergency shelter.</span>
        </button>

        <button style="border-left-color: var(--accent-gold) !important;">
            <<link "Ask if Thorne needs help ▼">>
                <<run $(".vn-dialogue-box").scrollTop(0)>>
                <<addTime 2>>
                <<set $thorne_help_offer to true>>
                <<goto "Act3_School_Infirmary">>
            <</link>>
            <span class="btn-sub">Offer assistance before asking for anything.</span>
        </button>
    </div>

<<elseif not $helped_thorne>>
    The infirmary is quieter than before, but not peaceful.
    <br><br>
    Someone coughs behind a curtain. A patient shifts beneath a thin blanket. The portable lamp continues to flicker over the treatment area.
    <br><br>
    Dr. Thorne is cleaning dried blood from a pair of forceps. He looks up when you enter, then returns to his work.
    <br><br>

    <<if $thorne_topic_patient>>
        <<chat "Dr. Thorne" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "The patient on that cot has a deep wound and a fever. I can keep him stable for now, but 'for now' is doing a lot of work.">>
        <br><br>
        He places the forceps on the tray.
        <br><br>
        <<chat "Dr. Thorne" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "People think the worst part is the wound. It usually isn't. Infection is quieter. It waits until everyone believes the danger has passed.">>
        <br><br>
    <</if>>

    <<if $thorne_topic_school>>
        <<chat "Dr. Thorne" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "The school had generators, running water, and enough classrooms to separate the sick from everyone else. That made it useful.">>
        <br><br>
        He glances toward the occupied cots.
        <br><br>
        <<chat "Dr. Thorne" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "Then the roads closed. Supplies stopped arriving. Useful became desperate.">>
        <br><br>
    <</if>>

    <<if $thorne_help_offer>>
        <<chat "Dr. Thorne" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "Help? Yes. I need help. But I don't need another person standing in the doorway telling me they're willing.">>
        <br><br>
        He opens a metal tray. Inside are a few used instruments, two empty medicine packets, and a roll of tape.
        <br><br>
        <<chat "Dr. Thorne" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "I need supplies. Clean bandages. Antibiotics. Painkillers. Anything that can keep an injury from becoming a death sentence.">>
        <br><br>
        He studies you for a moment.
        <br><br>
        <<chat "Dr. Thorne" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "Bring me something useful, and I'll remember that you came back.">>
        <br><br>
    <</if>>

    <<if $thorne_quest_active>>
        <<chat "Dr. Thorne" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "You're still looking for supplies. Good. Don't take unnecessary risks, but don't come back empty-handed either.">>
        <br><br>
        He gestures toward the occupied cots.
        <br><br>
        <<chat "Dr. Thorne" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "Every hour matters to someone in this room.">>
        <br><br>

    <<elseif $thorne_help_offer>>
        <div class="choice-menu" style="margin-top:20px;">
            <button style="border-left-color: var(--accent-green) !important;">
                <<link "Accept Thorne's medical supply mission ▼">>
                    <<run $(".vn-dialogue-box").scrollTop(0)>>
                    <<addTime 5>>
                    <<set $thorne_quest_active to true>>
                    <<addObjective "fetch_meds_thorne" "Find Antibiotics, Painkillers, a First Aid Kit, or clean Bandages for Dr. Thorne">>
                    <<goto "Act3_School_Infirmary">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-green);">[NEW OBJECTIVE]</b> Search for medical supplies.</span>
            </button>
            <button style="border-left-color: var(--accent-gold) !important;">
                <<link "Tell Thorne you need time to prepare ▼">>
                    <<run $(".vn-dialogue-box").scrollTop(0)>>
                    <<addTime 1>>
                    <<goto "Act3_School_Infirmary">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub">Leave the mission for later.</span>
            </button>
        </div>

    <<else>>
        <div class="choice-menu" style="margin-top:20px;">
            <button style="border-left-color: var(--accent-gold) !important;">
                <<link "Ask if Thorne needs help ▼">>
                    <<run $(".vn-dialogue-box").scrollTop(0)>>
                    <<addTime 2>>
                    <<set $thorne_help_offer to true>>
                    <<goto "Act3_School_Infirmary">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub">Ask what the infirmary needs.</span>
            </button>
        </div>
    <</if>>

    <<if $inventory.find(i => i.id === "Antibiotics" || i.id === "Painkillers" || i.id === "First Aid Kit" || i.id === "Bandage")>>
        <div class="choice-menu" style="margin-top:20px;">
            <button style="border-left-color: var(--accent-green) !important;">
                <<link "Give medical supplies to Dr. Thorne [INVENTORY] ▼">>
                    <<run $(".vn-dialogue-box").scrollTop(0)>>
                    <<addTime 10>>
                    <<set $helped_thorne to true>>
                    <<set $thorne_quest_active to false>>
                    <<completeObjective "fetch_meds_thorne">>
                    <<purgeCompleted>>
                    <<set $hum to Math.min(100, $hum + 20)>>
                    <<run window.gainXP(30)>>
                    <<run window.gainTrust(20)>>
                    <<if $inventory.find(i => i.id === "Antibiotics")>>
                        <<run setup.removeItem("Antibiotics", 1)>>
                    <<elseif $inventory.find(i => i.id === "Painkillers")>>
                        <<run setup.removeItem("Painkillers", 1)>>
                    <<elseif $inventory.find(i => i.id === "First Aid Kit")>>
                        <<run setup.removeItem("First Aid Kit", 1)>>
                    <<else>>
                        <<run setup.removeItem("Bandage", 1)>>
                    <</if>>
                    <<goto "Act3_School_Infirmary">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-green);">[+20 HUMANITY] [+20 TRUST] [+30 XP]</b> Hand over the medical supplies.</span>
            </button>
        </div>
    <</if>>

<<else>>
    The infirmary has changed.
    <br><br>
    The smell of blood is still there, but it no longer overwhelms everything else. Fresh bandages have replaced several of the stained ones. The supply tray is no longer empty.
    <br><br>
    A patient near the wall is sitting upright, drinking water. Another sleeps beneath a clean blanket.
    <br><br>
    Dr. Thorne stands beside the treatment table, organizing medicine into small labeled containers.
    <br><br>
    When he notices you, his expression softens slightly.
    <br><br>
    <<chat "Dr. Thorne" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "You came back. And you brought what we needed.">>
    <br><br>
    He closes one of the containers.
    <br><br>
    <<chat "Dr. Thorne" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "The patient from Cot Four is stable. He may even keep the leg. That's more than I was prepared to promise earlier.">>
    <br><br>
    Thorne looks across the room at the survivors resting on the cots.
    <br><br>
    <<chat "Dr. Thorne" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "You didn't just bring medicine. You bought these people time. Around here, time is worth more than almost anything.">>
    <br><br>

    <<if not $thorne_thanks_seen>>
        <<set $thorne_thanks_seen to true>>
        He reaches beneath the treatment table and places a compact medical kit beside you.
        <br><br>
        <<chat "Dr. Thorne" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "From now on, if you're hurt, come here. I won't promise miracles. I can promise I'll try.">>
        <br><br>
    <<else>>
        <<chat "Dr. Thorne" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "Try not to make a habit of needing me. But if you do, the infirmary is open.">>
        <br><br>
    <</if>>

    <<if $hp < $hp_max>>
        <div class="choice-menu" style="margin-top:20px;">
            <button style="border-left-color: var(--accent-green) !important;">
                <<link "Let Dr. Thorne treat your injuries ▼">>
                    <<run $(".vn-dialogue-box").scrollTop(0)>>
                    <<addTime 15>>
                    <<set $hp to $hp_max>>
                    <<goto "Act3_School_Infirmary">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-green);">[MAX HP RESTORED]</b> Thorne cleans and dresses your wounds.</span>
            </button>
        </div>
    <<else>>
        <span style="color:var(--accent-green); font-weight:bold;">Your wounds are treated, and your health is fully restored.</span>
        <br><br>
    <</if>>

    <<if not $thorne_followup_patients>>
        <div class="choice-menu" style="margin-top:20px;">
            <button style="border-left-color: var(--accent-gold) !important;">
                <<link "Ask Thorne how the patients are doing ▼">>
                    <<run $(".vn-dialogue-box").scrollTop(0)>>
                    <<addTime 3>>
                    <<set $thorne_followup_patients to true>>
                    <<goto "Act3_School_Infirmary">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub">Check on the survivors you helped.</span>
            </button>
        </div>
    <<else>>
        <<chat "Dr. Thorne" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "Better than yesterday. Not all of them are out of danger, but they're alive. That's enough for today.">>
        <br><br>
        He pauses before returning to his work.
        <br><br>
        <<chat "Dr. Thorne" "image/avatars/drthorne.gif" "right" "The school remembers who helps. People talk. You've earned more trust here than you may realize.">>
        <br><br>
    <</if>>
<</if>>

            </span>
        </div>
        
        <div class="choice-menu">
            <button style="border-left-color: var(--accent-blue) !important;">
                <<link "🚪 Exit Infirmary to Hallway [WEST]">>
                    <<set $currentLocation to "hall_g_east_1">>
                    <<goto "Act3_SchoolGFloor">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub">Leave Dr. Thorne's triage ward.</span>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
